WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.360
Be careful, Portland is on fire, our president says so, the rival gangs fighting, the clouds

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:15.880
of tear gas all around us, be careful.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:22.400
But actually, this isn't a war zone, whatever Trump says, it is perfectly peaceful.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.959
Legacy Media doesn't have any reporters filming the riots, and that's how the chief of police

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:28.240
likes it.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.400
What bothers him are the journalists who are fair and balanced.

